<speak>A short list is probably easier to live with, and those reminders are entirely for your own household routine. Thank you for giving me the space to work through the conversation without interruptions. I will now put the formal summary to you. To bring everything together, your final instruction is to sell 100 units of Atlas <sub alias="you ess dee">USD</sub> Corporate Bond 2031, with a transaction amount of 10,000 in <sub alias="you ess">US</sub> dollars, using a market order. Do you explicitly confirm this instruction for me to proceed? After your response, we can close the call without trying to fit in another administrative task. The separate matters we discussed can remain separate, and any future appointment can be arranged when you have your diary available. There is no need for you to stay in the meeting room just to settle routine scheduling today.</speak>